WEBVTT

00:39.437 --> 00:40.567
There it is.

00:40.567 --> 00:41.317
Huh?

00:49.157 --> 00:53.827
<b>Angel's Playbox Entrance</b>

00:49.317 --> 00:53.827
<i>Angel's Playbox Entrance.
Recommended level: 50.</i>

00:51.737 --> 00:53.827
<b>Recommended Level: 50</b>

02:03.167 --> 02:05.677
Same plan. Let's go.

02:05.677 --> 02:06.567
Got it!

02:19.747 --> 02:22.627
Was I useful, Mr. Elymas?

02:23.027 --> 02:27.467
Yeah. Ruche, thanks for 
teaming up with me.

02:31.257 --> 02:34.637
Did you want these 
Bear Shields that badly?

02:34.637 --> 02:38.107
Shall we collect ten of them today?

02:38.107 --> 02:40.517
No, you've gained enough levels.

02:40.807 --> 02:42.447
The real work starts now.

02:43.557 --> 02:44.317
What?

02:44.667 --> 02:46.617
<i>Level 20 reached.</i>

02:46.617 --> 02:49.577
Wow, you're right. When did that happen?

02:50.337 --> 02:55.337
Our new goal is hunting Golden Raana.

02:57.997 --> 03:00.627
G-Golden Raana?!

03:39.377 --> 03:40.627
<b>Loading</b>

03:51.887 --> 03:53.187
<b>Loading</b>

04:04.527 --> 04:05.817
<b>Loading</b>

04:14.077 --> 04:14.827
<b>Loading</b>

04:16.327 --> 04:21.917
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

04:16.337 --> 04:21.917
<b>Begin Adventure</b>

04:33.137 --> 04:37.597
<b>Episode 7\h\h\hGolden Raana Farming</b>

04:44.317 --> 04:45.487
<i>Raana.</i>

04:45.487 --> 04:48.647
<i>The frog monsters I defeated 
after coming to this world</i>

04:48.647 --> 04:52.527
<i>and beloved trash mob from </i>Magic World<i>.</i>

04:53.947 --> 04:55.527
Rampart Reflection!

04:57.977 --> 05:02.207
Though there are many variants,

05:02.697 --> 05:06.077
the Golden Raana is our current target.

05:07.977 --> 05:13.717
Given our situation, I determined 
we had to farm this dungeon next.

05:14.267 --> 05:19.267
The shiny Golden Raana 
has a low spawn rate,

05:19.267 --> 05:23.817
but they have a high chance of dropping 
an extremely valuable item.

05:25.637 --> 05:29.987
What's more, their Attack and Magic 
are low despite their high level,

05:29.987 --> 05:32.327
and they lack offensive skills.

05:33.597 --> 05:34.487
In other words,

05:34.837 --> 05:40.867
they're weak in combat while offering 
tons of EXP and valuable drops.

05:41.317 --> 05:44.167
You couldn't ask for a juicier monster!

05:45.377 --> 05:49.127
<i>There are several bonus characters 
like the Golden Raana.</i>

05:45.497 --> 05:45.827
<b>Croak</b>

05:46.127 --> 05:46.497
<b>Croak</b>

05:46.747 --> 05:47.127
<b>Croak</b>

05:47.377 --> 05:47.747
<b>Croak</b>

05:47.997 --> 05:48.377
<b>Croak</b>

05:48.627 --> 05:48.997
<b>Croak</b>

05:49.127 --> 05:52.877
<i>In </i>Magic World<i>, they were affectionately 
known as Golden Toads.</i>

05:49.247 --> 05:49.627
<b>Croak</b>

05:49.877 --> 05:50.257
<b>Croak</b>

05:50.507 --> 05:50.877
<b>Croak</b>

05:51.127 --> 05:51.507
<b>Croak</b>

05:51.757 --> 05:52.127
<b>Croak</b>

05:52.377 --> 05:52.757
<b>Croak</b>

05:53.137 --> 05:58.007
<i>Many players said farming them was
the most fun they had in the game.</i>

06:03.127 --> 06:08.647
<i>Golden Raana spawn frequently in 
the middle levels of the Angel's Playbox.</i>

06:09.477 --> 06:16.487
<i>And I know the best places to find 
every monster that appears here.</i>

06:18.127 --> 06:21.997
I've heard of Golden Raana, too.

06:22.267 --> 06:26.027
They say you can live off 
a single Golden Raana for years.

06:26.027 --> 06:28.877
That's what the adventurers 
at the bar said.

06:28.877 --> 06:32.127
Yeah? Then that makes things simple.

06:32.127 --> 06:34.647
They also said this...

06:35.877 --> 06:38.247
They're too quick to catch.

06:38.247 --> 06:43.197
Even if you land a hit, 
they don't seem to take any damage.

06:44.127 --> 06:47.557
It's not uncommon for people 
to chase them too far

06:47.557 --> 06:51.107
and find themselves 
surrounded by monsters.

06:52.387 --> 06:59.567
There could even be adventurers 
who died because of them!

06:54.187 --> 06:58.947
Tremble

06:54.187 --> 06:58.947
Tremble

06:54.187 --> 06:58.947
Tremble

07:01.487 --> 07:05.767
<i>That's right. This world is similar 
but different from the game.</i>

07:05.767 --> 07:07.707
<i>Death is the end here.</i>

07:08.017 --> 07:12.417
<i>People naturally tend to 
choose builds for survival.</i>

07:13.607 --> 07:17.047
<i>Farming Golden Raana must not be easy.</i>

07:18.177 --> 07:22.417
Golden Raana have exceptional 
Speed and Defense.

07:22.677 --> 07:23.927
Scratch

07:22.677 --> 07:23.927
Scratch

07:24.307 --> 07:30.687
They're also totally immune to elemental 
attacks, status effects, and debuffs.

07:31.127 --> 07:35.147
Aren't we powerless 
against something like that?

07:35.477 --> 07:41.157
The Ironpiercer knife you gave me is 
effective against high-Defense targets,

07:41.157 --> 07:46.157
but I doubt it'll damage a Golden Raana.

07:46.407 --> 07:50.167
I don't think I could even 
catch up to one.

07:50.797 --> 07:52.497
You're right.

07:53.637 --> 07:58.377
Golden Raana boast a Speed of 67 
and Defense of 200.

07:59.507 --> 08:06.617
The Ironpiercer's 15% Defense penetration 
is meaningless against its Golden Defense.

07:59.887 --> 08:04.387
<b>Attack: 67
 






Defense: 200</b>

08:02.427 --> 08:04.387
<b>15% Defense Penetration</b>

08:06.617 --> 08:07.887
But...

08:08.187 --> 08:13.147
<i>Its Speed is more than double 
Ruche's as a Pierrot.</i>

08:13.147 --> 08:18.527
<i>And it's more than triple mine 
as a slow Heavy Knight.</i>

08:18.527 --> 08:23.527
<b>Defense: 200</b>

08:18.877 --> 08:21.657
<i>Additionally, its Defense is 200.</i>

08:21.657 --> 08:27.537
<i>Even a perfect Rampart Reflection 
is completely negated by it.</i>

08:28.327 --> 08:32.827
<i>Vital Slice also has 
15% Defense penetration,</i>

08:33.117 --> 08:35.657
<i>but that's not nearly enough 
to deal damage.</i>

08:35.657 --> 08:36.857
Um...

08:37.607 --> 08:40.147
Are we sure this isn't impossible?

08:40.147 --> 08:41.287
Don't worry.

08:42.107 --> 08:43.847
I've got a plan to farm them.

08:45.767 --> 08:50.197
Even its seemingly 
perfect defense has holes.

08:50.197 --> 08:51.307
What?!

08:51.307 --> 08:56.977
But do you have a skill 
that can damage Golden Raana?

08:56.977 --> 09:01.047
I've never heard of Heavy Knights 
having skills like that.

09:06.077 --> 09:07.657
I'm counting on you, Ruche.

09:08.557 --> 09:12.667
Me?!

09:13.117 --> 09:18.817
Anyway, you should have eight 
skill points from leveling up just now.

09:19.877 --> 09:23.137
Put all of them 
into the Fool's Acrobatics.

09:23.587 --> 09:27.997
The two skills you'll gain from that 
are the key to our strategy.

09:28.887 --> 09:33.517
Um, I'm glad you have 
such high hopes for me,

09:33.517 --> 09:35.807
but I don't have that kind of power.

09:50.197 --> 09:52.997
Okay, Ruche. Let's run while we can.

09:52.997 --> 09:56.207
Okay. I could probably finish it off,
 but you're sure, right?

09:53.747 --> 09:56.207
<b>Monster: Toy Box</b>

09:56.497 --> 09:59.647
Yeah. That isn't our target,

09:59.647 --> 10:01.847
and it'll start calling allies 
once it feels cornered.

10:03.037 --> 10:08.217
Do we really want to narrow 
our focus to Golden Raana?

10:08.217 --> 10:10.557
With your stability and knowledge,

10:10.557 --> 10:16.647
if we defeat other monsters, I could 
probably gain three more levels today.

10:17.077 --> 10:22.647
It's fine. We're currently the perfect 
level for farming Golden Raana.

10:26.897 --> 10:29.487
Good. It's not chasing us.

10:32.857 --> 10:36.027
Besides, I assumed 
we wouldn't find one right away.

10:36.027 --> 10:37.537
Really?

10:37.537 --> 10:42.247
If we search all day, 
we might find two.

10:42.247 --> 10:46.497
Th-They're that rare?

10:46.497 --> 10:47.427
But...

10:49.067 --> 10:52.847
Golden Raana are worth 
the time and effort.

10:54.117 --> 10:55.277
Gulp.

10:56.417 --> 11:01.727
But no matter how high your Luck is, 
they're still hard to encounter.

11:02.027 --> 11:05.777
Let me know if you start 
to feel anxious or unhappy.

11:07.907 --> 11:09.367
Don't worry.

11:10.037 --> 11:12.327
I was only a little worried.

11:12.327 --> 11:14.837
I'll follow you anywhere, Mr. Elymas.

11:15.777 --> 11:19.667
Thanks, but you don't need to hold back.

11:19.947 --> 11:23.057
Let's farm a hundred or even 
a thousand Golden Raana!

11:23.057 --> 11:24.967
I'll show you that I can do it!

11:26.157 --> 11:28.467
<i>I'm glad she's motivated,</i>

11:28.467 --> 11:33.167
<i>but the market in Rondalm would 
explode if we farmed that many.</i>

11:41.647 --> 11:42.947
Is that...

11:57.517 --> 11:59.277
A Golden Raana?!

12:03.587 --> 12:05.057
Don't worry.

12:05.787 --> 12:08.627
I'll follow you anywhere, Mr. Elymas.

12:16.817 --> 12:18.097
Is that...

12:31.317 --> 12:33.057
A Golden Raana?!

12:39.117 --> 12:41.967
<i>We found one way sooner than I expected.</i>

12:42.377 --> 12:45.027
W-We found one. We found one.

12:45.027 --> 12:46.707
What should we do?

12:46.707 --> 12:48.467
Deep breaths, Ruche.

12:48.467 --> 12:52.067
We need to stay calm 
if we want to defeat it.

12:52.067 --> 12:53.027
Got it.

12:54.757 --> 12:55.677
<b>exhale</b>

12:55.927 --> 12:56.757
<b>inhale</b>

12:57.007 --> 12:57.927
<b>exhale</b>

12:58.137 --> 12:58.677
<b>inhale</b>

12:58.137 --> 12:58.677
<b>inhale</b>

13:00.597 --> 13:05.107
You reached Fool's Acrobatics 10 with
 the skill points from leveling up, right?

13:05.107 --> 13:11.067
Yes. I acquired 
the two skills you mentioned.

13:11.457 --> 13:13.567
Good. Follow the plan.

13:14.537 --> 13:15.307
Okay.

13:17.487 --> 13:23.277
I'll wait here for the Golden Raana, 
so herd it towards me.

13:27.337 --> 13:27.997
Ruche?

13:27.337 --> 13:32.837
<b>Tense</b>

13:27.997 --> 13:29.747
It's okay, Ruche.

13:29.747 --> 13:32.837
I can do it. I can do it. I can do it...

13:36.367 --> 13:40.347
Um, it's okay if you mess up.

13:39.347 --> 13:43.847
<b>Tense</b>

13:40.347 --> 13:42.467
Deep breaths, deep breaths.

13:51.737 --> 13:52.927
Here I go.

13:55.817 --> 13:58.407
I've got this!

13:58.747 --> 14:04.007
<i>Golden Raana begin running when 
an adventurer gets within four meters.</i>

14:04.417 --> 14:10.167
<b>Croak</b>

14:04.417 --> 14:09.487
<i>And the corridors in the Angel's 
Playbox are four meters wide.</i>

14:10.437 --> 14:13.297
<i>Even when a Golden Raana 
is at the edge of a corridor,</i>

14:13.297 --> 14:15.947
<i>you just barely can't get around them.</i>

14:16.947 --> 14:21.307
<i>But that's only if you're 
walking on the floor.</i>

14:24.277 --> 14:26.317
<i>Acrobatic Amble!</i>

14:39.407 --> 14:40.907
You're not getting away!

14:41.747 --> 14:45.787
Doppellusion!

14:43.747 --> 14:45.787
<b>Doppellusion</b>

14:46.517 --> 14:50.547
<i>It's impossible to slip past those 
illusions in corridors this wide.</i>

14:50.977 --> 14:56.177
<i>And the cowardly Golden Raana 
won't charge into it.</i>

14:56.857 --> 15:02.717
<i>Their status effect immunity means 
they can't be blinded or hallucinate,</i>

15:03.147 --> 15:07.587
<i>but they can't see through 
the illusions created by Doppellusion.</i>

15:08.307 --> 15:12.317
<i>This is one of the holes 
in their resistances.</i>

15:14.027 --> 15:16.357
Mr. Elymas, it's running your way!

15:18.627 --> 15:22.447
<i>Another is that Shadow Stomp
 works on them.</i>

15:24.047 --> 15:27.107
<i>It comes down to whether 
or not I can land it.</i>

15:28.247 --> 15:32.297
<i>The corridors are narrow, 
but it's three times faster than me.</i>

15:32.297 --> 15:36.497
<i>My shadow's only 
50 centimeters long, but...</i>

15:39.167 --> 15:42.597
I can't screw up when this was my idea!

15:44.667 --> 15:47.447
<i>I bought these Magic Stones 
when we got Ironpiercer.</i>

15:46.177 --> 15:51.437
<b>Magic Stone <b>[Holy Type] 
Spend MP to fill with mana and release healing light</b></b>

15:47.917 --> 15:51.437
<i>Their healing isn't very effective, 
so they're rarely used for that.</i>

15:54.157 --> 15:56.177
<i>But they can also be used like this!</i>

16:08.827 --> 16:10.377
<b>Shadow Stomp</b>

16:09.377 --> 16:10.377
<i>Shadow Stomp!</i>

16:14.377 --> 16:17.217
We've got you now, Golden Raana!

16:17.217 --> 16:19.607
We did it, Mr. Elymas!

16:20.837 --> 16:23.847
It's as good as dead now!

16:27.277 --> 16:31.347
What? But how do you plan to kill it?

16:30.897 --> 16:34.357
<b>Flail</b>

16:35.037 --> 16:37.487
We'll have to score critical hits.

16:38.047 --> 16:40.117
Critical hits?

16:41.357 --> 16:48.117
Reading your opponent's movements 
and landing the perfect hit

16:41.707 --> 16:42.927
<i>Critical.</i>

16:48.427 --> 16:52.537
deals 1.5 times normal damage and 
ignores 50% of your target's Defense.

16:52.537 --> 16:58.917
I see. And you've got all the time in 
the world to try for critical hits, right?

16:59.657 --> 17:01.927
You can do it, My. Elymas.

17:02.267 --> 17:07.517
My critical hits don't do 
enough damage to affect it.

17:08.287 --> 17:09.167
What?

17:09.167 --> 17:12.017
Didn't I say I was counting on you?

17:12.407 --> 17:14.017
What?!

17:14.737 --> 17:19.207
Scoring critical hits 
requires skill and luck.

17:14.737 --> 17:17.347
<i>Miss. Miss.</i>

17:18.487 --> 17:19.527
<i>Critical.</i>

17:19.517 --> 17:25.027
<b>Flail</b>

17:20.027 --> 17:24.567
I can't go for critical hits right now 
because I can't move.

17:25.357 --> 17:31.037
But I've barely scored 
any critical hits before.

17:31.287 --> 17:33.037
It'd be impossible if you 
attacked normally.

17:33.527 --> 17:38.797
But you have your 
original skill, Dice Thrust.

17:39.637 --> 17:42.187
Dice Thrust?

17:42.187 --> 17:45.527
Listen, you don't have 
any decent attack skills.

17:45.527 --> 17:49.947
You just soak up some hits. 
That's the problem.

17:49.947 --> 17:52.517
You're not actually useful.

17:52.517 --> 18:00.937
You finally learned an attack skill, but 
it's worth even less than a normal attack.

18:02.997 --> 18:04.177
That's...

18:04.947 --> 18:08.227
<i>Skill: Dice Thrust. A thrusting skill.</i>

18:05.407 --> 18:06.487
<i>Miss.</i>

18:07.447 --> 18:10.697
<b>Dice Thrust [Common Skill]
A thrusting skill
 Rolls a six-sided die and grants an
 additional effect based on the rolled result</b>

18:08.227 --> 18:14.207
<i>Rolls a six-sided die and grants a bonus
 effect based on the rolled result.</i>

18:10.697 --> 18:12.007
<i>Critical.</i>

18:19.647 --> 18:22.417
I guess that could work.

18:22.757 --> 18:24.927
Exactly. On a six, you get...

18:24.927 --> 18:26.927
A guaranteed critical!

18:27.297 --> 18:32.947
A six multiplies your attack by 1.3 
and guarantees a critical hit.

18:34.057 --> 18:40.687
<b>Total Multiplier x1.95</b>

18:34.317 --> 18:37.527
In total, that's 1.95 times damage.

18:37.527 --> 18:44.317
Plus, Ironpiercer's 15% penetration 
and a critical's 50% penetration stack.

18:40.857 --> 18:44.697
<b>Ironpiercer 15% penetration</b>

18:41.937 --> 18:44.697
<b>Critical 50% Penetration</b>

18:45.047 --> 18:51.367
In other words, a six hits with 
1.95 times Attack and 65% penetration.

18:46.067 --> 18:51.367
<b>Attack x1.95</b>

18:48.067 --> 18:51.367
<b>Defense Penetration 65%</b>

18:52.617 --> 18:56.117
<b>Flail</b>

18:53.177 --> 18:56.117
Will this really work, though?

18:56.827 --> 19:01.127
Their use may be limited 
or they may be late bloomers,

19:01.557 --> 19:04.127
but there isn't a single 
useless class or skill.

19:05.277 --> 19:08.377
Don't let any individual's 
assessment get to you.

19:08.377 --> 19:13.137
You just seemed underwhelming 
to Cline's party.

19:14.527 --> 19:16.137
I'll say it again, Ruche.

19:16.877 --> 19:19.297
I need you.

19:20.947 --> 19:23.017
I hope you'll keep 
lending me your strength.

19:32.897 --> 19:34.737
I'll do it.

19:34.737 --> 19:37.627
When you expect so much from me, 
I can't let you down.

19:38.597 --> 19:41.667
Otherwise, what would be the
point of being an adventurer?

19:42.207 --> 19:44.417
Yeah! I'm counting on you, Ruche!

19:49.337 --> 19:51.397
Dice Thrust!

20:12.367 --> 20:13.627
<i>Critical.</i>

20:34.387 --> 20:36.837
W-We actually did it.

20:37.307 --> 20:39.887
<i>Level 27 reached.</i>

20:39.887 --> 20:44.477
We did it! I'm level 27!

20:46.087 --> 20:48.367
<i>Level 30 reached.</i>

20:47.487 --> 20:50.487
Golden Raana are worth a lot of EXP,

20:51.117 --> 20:54.487
but the best part is 
the valuable item drops.

20:55.437 --> 20:57.997
The drop rate is 50%.

21:22.077 --> 21:24.027
<i>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade.</i>

21:23.227 --> 21:33.277
<b>Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade</b>

21:24.027 --> 21:29.007
<i>Attack: +12. 
Market price: 17,000,000 gold.</i>

21:24.307 --> 21:33.277
<b>Attack: +12
 Market Price: 17,000,000G
A glittering Raana short sword
 A hunk of high-purity Raana Gold</b>

21:29.007 --> 21:30.857
<i>A glittering Raana short sword.</i>

21:30.857 --> 21:33.277
<i>A hunk of high-purity Raana Gold.</i>

21:34.177 --> 21:37.397
We got a Dazzling Raana Decorative Blade!

21:56.047 --> 21:59.557
<b>Translator:
Sho Stifler

Timer:
Krzysztof Kunc

Editor:
Salem Alabanza

Quality Control:
Gabriella Alabanza

Final Quality Control:
Sriram Gurunathan</b>

23:10.917 --> 23:16.257
<i>Both Ruche and I gained tons of levels 
by killing the Golden Raana.</i>

23:16.667 --> 23:18.797
<i>But it's not enough.</i>

23:18.797 --> 23:21.887
<i>We don't have nearly enough 
to buy that skillbook.</i>

23:22.517 --> 23:26.057
<i>Grinding levels and gold is fun.</i>

23:26.937 --> 23:30.647
<i>But this world isn't a game.</i>

23:32.287 --> 23:34.687
<i>Next time, "Wandering."</i>

23:35.357 --> 23:39.727
<i>Falling in this world 
means dying for real.</i>
